# ANUSANDHAN — Python research project
# Python-first ignores for Windows, macOS and Linux, plus research artifacts.
#
# Deliberately NOT ignored (stay tracked by design):
# - Shareable project configuration: pyproject.toml, setup.py/cfg,
#   requirements*.txt, environment.yml, tox.ini, Dockerfile,
#   docker-compose.yml, .editorconfig, .pre-commit-config.yaml,
#   CI workflows, and pytest/ruff/mypy configuration.
# - Dataset documentation: dataset cards (*.md), provenance notes,
#   metadata and licensing files. Only local/generated data content
#   (large, binary or reproducible artifacts) is ignored below.
# - Jupyter notebooks (*.ipynb); only their checkpoints are ignored.
# - `.env.example`; only real environment/secret files are ignored.

# --- Python bytecode and caches ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# --- C extensions ---
*.so

# --- Distribution and packaging ---
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
pip-wheel-metadata/
share/python-wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

# --- Virtual environments ---
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
env.bak/
venv.bak/
__pypackages__/

# --- Test, coverage and QA caches ---
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.tox/
.nox/
.cache/
nosetests.xml
coverage.xml
*.cover
*.py,cover
.hypothesis/
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt

# --- Type checkers and linters ---
.mypy_cache/
.dmypy.json
dmypy.json
.ruff_cache/
.pyre/
.pytype/

# --- Jupyter checkpoints (notebooks stay tracked) ---
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*/.ipynb_checkpoints/*

# --- Secrets and local environment files ---
# `.env` also covers a virtualenv unfortunately named `.env`.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets/

# --- Research data: local and generated content only ---
# `data/` itself is NOT ignored. Documentation, dataset cards, provenance,
# metadata and licensing files stay tracked. Curated fixtures can be
# force-added with `git add -f` when truly needed.
*.parquet
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.hdf
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.npy
*.npz
*.csv
*.tsv
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.duckdb
*.feather
*.arrow
*.zarr/
*.lmdb/

# --- Research models and checkpoints ---
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.safetensors
*.pb
*.tflite
*.mlmodel
*.gguf
checkpoints/
pretrained/

# --- Experiment tracking, outputs and logs ---
mlruns/
mlartifacts/
wandb/
runs/
lightning_logs/
outputs/
results/
artifacts/
logs/
*.log

# --- Documentation build output ---
docs/_build/
site/

# --- Temporary and backup files ---
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.orig
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- OS: Windows ---
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
[Dd]esktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# --- OS: macOS ---
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# --- OS: Linux ---
.fuse_hidden*
.directory
.Trash-*
.nfs*

# --- Editors and IDEs ---
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace
.project
.pydevproject

# --- Explicitly preserved: documentation and licensing ---
# Safety net: these are never ignored above and must always stay tracked.
!*.md
!LICENSE*
!LICENCE*
